1. User should be able to search products.
2. User should be able to view product details.
3. User should be able to add/remove products from the cart.
4. User should be able to update product quantity in the cart.
5. User should be able to place an order and generate an Order ID.
6. System should calculate the total order amount.
7. User should be able to make a payment.
8. User should be able to track the order status.
9. System should maintain inventory.
10. System should update inventory after a successful order.



NFR

1. The design should be modular.
2. The design should have low coupling and high cohesion.
3. The design should follow SOLID principles.
4. The design should be scalable.
5. The design should be maintainable and testable.
6. The design should support adding new payment methods in the future.




